  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Portfolio Aesthetics**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on the aesthetic direction for Thomas Nguyen\'s portfolio. I\'m aiming for a minimalist, high-end feel, drawing inspiration from Iman Gadzhi\'s architectural style. The goal is to create a clean and impactful presentation. This needs to translate to a high-ticket look and feel.\n\n\n**Defining Visual Specifications**\n\nI\'ve nailed down the visual specifications. I\'m going with an absolute black background (#050505) and precise typography: EB Garamond (or Cormorant Garamond if it looks better) for headings, and Inter for body text. Design tokens are defined. I\'ve read the `frontend-design` skill and will initialize `lucide-react` icons. I\'m setting up Google Fonts and, after exploring alternatives, I\'m leaning toward EB Garamond. Massive padding is also critical.\n\n\n"
