  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Nguyen\'s Portfolio**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the initial design concept for Thomas Nguyen\'s high-end portfolio website. The goal is a minimalist aesthetic, incorporating \"Editorial/Magazine Hero\" and \"Dark Luxury\" design principles. I\'ve established the foundational color palette, using a #050505 background and #FFFFFF primary text. Next up, I need to choose secondary text color and content hierarchy.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Elements**\n\nI\'ve decided on #A0A0A0 for the secondary text, a divider of rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), and an accent glow of rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03). For typography, I\'ve selected EB Garamond for emphasis \342\200\223 it provides the high-contrast serif requested. Inter will be the functional font. I\'m planning massive section padding. I\'m visualizing a Vanta hero section, and will prioritize that for immediate layout, text, and effects considerations.\n\n\n**Defining Hero and Sections**\n\nI\'m now outlining the hero section with a cinematic ultra-wide video player showcasing the \"2026 MASTER REEL\". Following that, I\'m sketching out a 2x4 responsive shorts grid with a strict 9:16 vertical ratio. I\'m imagining grayscale thumbnails on hover that animate to color with silent playback and category tags. For mobile, the grid will be a single column with horizontal scroll. I\'m structuring a philosophy section with large-scale centered typography. Finally, I\'ll incorporate a minimalist footer-contact hybrid with primary and secondary CTAs. I\'ll need to focus on implementing transitions using cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) and WebM placeholders. I\'ll need to focus on implementing transitions and placeholders.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "id3jvgsz"
      name: "edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Add global styles and fonts to index.css\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"@import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\');\\n@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@theme {\\n  --color-background: #050505;\\n  --color-primary: #FFFFFF;\\n  --color-secondary: #A0A0A0;\\n  --color-divider: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\\n  --color-accent-glow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\\n  \\n  --font-serif: \'EB Garamond\', serif;\\n  --font-sans: \'Inter\', sans-serif;\\n}\\n\\nbody {\\n  background-color: var(--color-background);\\n  color: var(--color-primary);\\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\\n  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\\n  overflow-x: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n/* Mouse-follow glow effect */\\n.glow-effect {\\n  position: fixed;\\n  top: 0;\\n  left: 0;\\n  width: 100vw;\\n  height: 100vh;\\n  pointer-events: none;\\n  z-index: 0;\\n  background: radial-gradient(\\n    circle 600px at var(--mouse-x, 50vw) var(--mouse-y, 50vh),\\n    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03),\\n    transparent 80%\\n  );\\n}\\n\\n/* Cinematic Grain */\\n.noise-overlay {\\n  position: fixed;\\n  top: 0;\\n  left: 0;\\n  width: 100vw;\\n  height: 100vh;\\n  pointer-events: none;\\n  z-index: 50;\\n  opacity: 0.04;\\n  background-image: url(\\\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=\'0 0 400 400\' xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%3E%3Cfilter id=\'noiseFilter\'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=\'fractalNoise\' baseFrequency=\'0.9\' numOctaves=\'3\' stitchTiles=\'stitch\'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=\'100%25\' height=\'100%25\' filter=\'url(%23noiseFilter)\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\\\");\\n}\\n\\n/* Hide scrollbar for smooth horizontal scrolling */\\n.hide-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  display: none;\\n}\\n.hide-scrollbar {\\n  -ms-overflow-style: none;  /* IE and Edge */\\n  scrollbar-width: none;  /* Firefox */\\n}\",\"TargetContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\",\"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\",\"toolAction\":\"Editing index.css\",\"toolSummary\":\"Add fonts and styles\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "edit_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 849815054
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
