  planner_response {
    response: "I\'ve built the high-ticket portfolio for Thomas Nguyen. The design strictly follows the minimalist architecture requested, utilizing a pure black layout paired with elegant, authoritative typography and subtle interactions. \n\nHere are the critical architectural decisions implemented:\n\n* **Typography & Contrast Design:** Implemented *EB Garamond Bold* for commanding headlines and high-status ROI metrics, combined with *Inter* for extremely legible, sharp sub-headline functional reading.\n* **Massive \"Void\" Spacing:** Enforced extremely aggressive section padding (`py-32`/`py-48`), ensuring assets breathe and generate a premium, museum-like perceived value.\n* **Hero Architecture:** A screen-centered layout with dynamic clamp scaling for the main title, supported by a 10% opacity granular film noise overlay and a radial mouse-follow illumination effect to create subtle, constant engagement.\n* **The System Grid:** A disciplined 4-column structured grid dividing the technical pillars with hairline borders, mirroring a high-tier agency layout.\n* **Master Showreel:** An expansive 16:9 cinematic container utilizing hover-states to shift from a high-contrast monochrome aesthetic into an active focus mode.\n* **Short-Form Mastery:** A horizontal-scrolling reel on mobile that elegantly snaps into a precise 2x4 grid on desktop monitors. The tiles are grayscale by default, awakening into full saturation on hover.\n* **Precision Animation Engine:** Used strict cubic-bezier easing `[0.16, 1, 0.3, 1]` everywhere via `motion` to mimic the premium, heavy-inertia feel characteristic of high-ticket After Effects motions. \n\nThe application is deployed and ready. Let me know if you\'d like to tweak any typographic weights or layout intervals further!"
    modified_response: "I\'ve built the high-ticket portfolio for Thomas Nguyen. The design strictly follows the minimalist architecture requested, utilizing a pure black layout paired with elegant, authoritative typography and subtle interactions. \n\nHere are the critical architectural decisions implemented:\n\n* **Typography & Contrast Design:** Implemented *EB Garamond Bold* for commanding headlines and high-status ROI metrics, combined with *Inter* for extremely legible, sharp sub-headline functional reading.\n* **Massive \"Void\" Spacing:** Enforced extremely aggressive section padding (`py-32`/`py-48`), ensuring assets breathe and generate a premium, museum-like perceived value.\n* **Hero Architecture:** A screen-centered layout with dynamic clamp scaling for the main title, supported by a 10% opacity granular film noise overlay and a radial mouse-follow illumination effect to create subtle, constant engagement.\n* **The System Grid:** A disciplined 4-column structured grid dividing the technical pillars with hairline borders, mirroring a high-tier agency layout.\n* **Master Showreel:** An expansive 16:9 cinematic container utilizing hover-states to shift from a high-contrast monochrome aesthetic into an active focus mode.\n* **Short-Form Mastery:** A horizontal-scrolling reel on mobile that elegantly snaps into a precise 2x4 grid on desktop monitors. The tiles are grayscale by default, awakening into full saturation on hover.\n* **Precision Animation Engine:** Used strict cubic-bezier easing `[0.16, 1, 0.3, 1]` everywhere via `motion` to mimic the premium, heavy-inertia feel characteristic of high-ticket After Effects motions. \n\nThe application is deployed and ready. Let me know if you\'d like to tweak any typographic weights or layout intervals further!"
