  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Sophisticated Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Sophisticated Dark\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=1024, height=768\\\">\\n  <title>Thomas Nguyen | Strategic Minimalist</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root {\\n      --bg: #050505;\\n      --text-main: #FFFFFF;\\n      --text-muted: #A0A0A0;\\n      --divider: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\\n      --accent-glow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\\n      --f-serif: \'Georgia\', \'Times New Roman\', serif;\\n      --f-sans: \'Inter\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif;\\n    }\\n\\n    * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      padding: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    body, html {\\n      width: 1024px;\\n      height: 768px;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      background-color: var(--bg);\\n      color: var(--text-main);\\n      font-family: var(--f-sans);\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      position: relative;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Cinematic Grain Overlay */\\n    .overlay {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: 0;\\n      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--accent-glow) 0%, transparent 70%);\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      z-index: 1;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Header */\\n    header {\\n      padding: 40px 60px;\\n      display: flex;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-label {\\n      font-size: 10px;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.4em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Hero Section */\\n    .hero {\\n      flex-grow: 1;\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      text-align: center;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n      padding-bottom: 20px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-name {\\n      font-family: var(--f-serif);\\n      font-size: 110px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n      letter-spacing: -0.01em;\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-tagline {\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.6em;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      max-width: 600px;\\n      line-height: 1.6;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* System Grid */\\n    .system-footer {\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);\\n      z-index: 2;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar {\\n      padding: 40px 30px;\\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--divider);\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar:last-child {\\n      border-right: none;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar-num {\\n      font-family: var(--f-serif);\\n      font-style: italic;\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\\n      display: block;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar-title {\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.1em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar-desc {\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n      line-height: 1.5;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Floating Call to Action */\\n    .cta-fixed {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      right: 60px;\\n      top: 50%;\\n      transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(90deg);\\n      transform-origin: right center;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n    }\\n\\n    .cta-btn {\\n      background: none;\\n      border: 1px solid var(--text-main);\\n      color: var(--text-main);\\n      padding: 12px 32px;\\n      font-size: 10px;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.3em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      cursor: pointer;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Showreel Frame Placeholder */\\n    .reel-hint {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      left: 60px;\\n      top: 50%;\\n      transform: translateY(-50%);\\n      width: 140px;\\n      height: 250px;\\n      border: 1px solid var(--divider);\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      justify-content: flex-end;\\n      padding: 15px;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n    }\\n\\n    .reel-hint-label {\\n      font-family: var(--f-serif);\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      font-style: italic;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n    }\\n\\n    .philosophy-void {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      bottom: 240px;\\n      width: 100%;\\n      text-align: center;\\n      font-family: var(--f-serif);\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      font-style: italic;\\n      opacity: 0.4;\\n      z-index: 1;\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"overlay\\\"></div>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <span class=\\\"nav-label\\\">STRATEGY \342\200\242 2026</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"nav-label\\\">RETENTION ARCHITECT</span>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"reel-hint\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height: 80%; width: 100%; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #111, #050505); margin-bottom: 10px;\\\"></div>\\n    <span class=\\\"reel-hint-label\\\">2026 REEL</span>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n    <h1 class=\\\"hero-name\\\">THOMAS NGUYEN</h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"hero-tagline\\\">I BUY BACK YOUR TIME & WEAPONIZE YOUR RETENTION.</p>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"philosophy-void\\\">\\n    \\\"I don\'t sell hours. I sell a Visual System that multiplies your views.\\\"\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"cta-fixed\\\">\\n    <button class=\\\"cta-btn\\\">LET\'S CHAT</button>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"system-footer\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pillar-num\\\">01</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pillar-title\\\">Retention Pacing</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"pillar-desc\\\">Neuro-editing techniques to eliminate dead air and force continuous attention.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pillar-num\\\">02</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pillar-title\\\">Premium Animation</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"pillar-desc\\\">Bespoke After Effects motion and custom transitions that elevate brand value.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pillar-num\\\">03</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pillar-title\\\">AI Visual Assets</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"pillar-desc\\\">Exclusive prompt-engineered B-roll replacing generic, low-status stock footage.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pillar-num\\\">04</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pillar-title\\\">Sound Architecture</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"pillar-desc\\\">Multi-layered SFX design engineered to anchor deep subconscious engagement.</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Sophisticated Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Sophisticated Dark\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=1024, height=768\\\">\\n  <title>Thomas Nguyen | Strategic Minimalist</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root {\\n      --bg: #050505;\\n      --text-main: #FFFFFF;\\n      --text-muted: #A0A0A0;\\n      --divider: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\\n      --accent-glow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\\n      --f-serif: \'Georgia\', \'Times New Roman\', serif;\\n      --f-sans: \'Inter\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif;\\n    }\\n\\n    * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      padding: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    body, html {\\n      width: 1024px;\\n      height: 768px;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      background-color: var(--bg);\\n      color: var(--text-main);\\n      font-family: var(--f-sans);\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      position: relative;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Cinematic Grain Overlay */\\n    .overlay {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: 0;\\n      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--accent-glow) 0%, transparent 70%);\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      z-index: 1;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Header */\\n    header {\\n      padding: 40px 60px;\\n      display: flex;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-label {\\n      font-size: 10px;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.4em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Hero Section */\\n    .hero {\\n      flex-grow: 1;\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      text-align: center;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n      padding-bottom: 20px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-name {\\n      font-family: var(--f-serif);\\n      font-size: 110px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n      letter-spacing: -0.01em;\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-tagline {\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.6em;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      max-width: 600px;\\n      line-height: 1.6;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* System Grid */\\n    .system-footer {\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);\\n      z-index: 2;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar {\\n      padding: 40px 30px;\\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--divider);\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar:last-child {\\n      border-right: none;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar-num {\\n      font-family: var(--f-serif);\\n      font-style: italic;\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\\n      display: block;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar-title {\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.1em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pillar-desc {\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      color: var(--text-muted);\\n      line-height: 1.5;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Floating Call to Action */\\n    .cta-fixed {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      right: 60px;\\n      top: 50%;\\n      transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(90deg);\\n      transform-origin: right center;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n    }\\n\\n    .cta-btn {\\n      background