r\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pillar-num\\\">01</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pillar-title\\\">Retention Pacing</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"pillar-desc\\\">Neuro-editing techniques to eliminate dead air and force continuous attention.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pillar-num\\\">02</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pillar-title\\\">Premium Animation</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"pillar-desc\\\">Bespoke After Effects motion and custom transitions that elevate brand value.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pillar-num\\\">03</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pillar-title\\\">AI Visual Assets</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"pillar-desc\\\">Exclusive prompt-engineered B-roll replacing generic, low-status stock footage.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pillar-num\\\">04</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pillar-title\\\">Sound Architecture</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"pillar-desc\\\">Multi-layered SFX design engineered to anchor deep subconscious engagement.</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
