  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining UI Component**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the hero section and call to action within App.tsx. I\'m working on the styling, specifically the font sizes and responsive layout, using clamp to ensure scalability. I\'m striving for optimal readability on all screen sizes, while maintaining the brand\'s aesthetic.\n\n\n**Enhancing Text Hierarchy**\n\nI\'ve transitioned from adjusting font sizes with `clamp` to using specific `text-6xl` and `md:text-[110px]` classes to refine the text hierarchy within the hero section. I\'m focusing on the visual impact and the responsive design of the hero section text, especially on larger screens. I am also adjusting the font to reflect the company\'s brand.\n\n\n**Adjusting Hero Content**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the secondary text and button within the hero section, aiming for better visual balance. I\'m tweaking the `mt` spacing and font sizes to complement the primary text and the responsive layout. I\'m working with uppercase to ensure the branding is reflected in the hero component. Also, I\'m improving the hover and tap states on the button, in line with modern UI conventions.\n\n```tsx\n            <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-x-8 gap-y-16\">\n              {pillars.map((pillar, idx) => (\n                <div key={idx} className=\"flex flex-col border-t border-divider pt-6\">\n                  <span className=\"text-secondary text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em]\">\n                    {pillar.title}\n                  </span>\n                  <p className=\"mt-4 text-primary text-[14px] leading-[1.8]\">{pillar.description}</p>\n                </div>\n              ))}\n            </div>\n```\n\n\n**Revising Pillar Styling**\n\nI\'ve shifted my attention to the pillar components, applying new styles. I\'m focusing on the visual flow and enhancing readability. I\'ve switched from border-top to a uniform border around the pillar, with a different font, padding, and spacing. I\'m now exploring how these adjustments affect the overall visual hierarchy and impact of the design.\n\n\n**Simplifying Typography**\n\nI\'m now refining the pillar component\'s text elements for improved clarity, reducing the text size and line height. I\'ve streamlined the text to make it more concise and accessible. I\'m also revising the heading in the hero section for conciseness.\n\n\n**Refining Button Design**\n\nI\'m now revising the button styling, aiming for a cleaner visual style. I\'ve adjusted the padding, font sizes, and tracking to create a more balanced look, and I\'ve reduced the size of the ArrowUpRight icon. The goal is to improve the overall call-to-action within the component. I\'ve also focused on the flex and gap properties for a neater layout.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "4ms2a32i"
      name: "multi_edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Update layout and component styling to match Sophisticated Dark theme\",\"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"ReplacementContent\":\"            <h1 className=\\\"font-serif font-bold text-white mt-12 md:mt-0 leading-none tracking-[-0.01em] w-full text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-[110px]\\\">\\n              THOMAS NGUYEN\\n            </h1>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-6 md:mt-8 text-[11px] leading-[1.6] tracking-[0.6em] text-secondary uppercase max-w-[600px]\\\">\\n              I buy back your time & weaponize your retention.\\n            </p>\\n            <motion.button \\n              whileHover={{ scale: 1.02 }}\\n              whileTap={{ scale: 0.98 }}\\n              className=\\\"mt-16 sm:mt-24 px-[32px] py-[12px] bg-transparent text-primary text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-white/5 border border-primary flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-max mx-auto group\\\"\\n            >\\n              Let\'s Chat \\n              <ArrowRight size={14} className=\\\"group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\\\" />\\n            </motion.button>\",\"TargetContent\":\"            <h1 className=\\\"font-serif font-bold text-white uppercase leading-[0.85] tracking-[0.02em] w-full\\\" style={{ fontSize: \'clamp(4rem, 15vw, 12rem)\' }}>\\n              THOMAS NGUYEN\\n            </h1>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-8 md:mt-12 text-[10px] sm:text-xs md:text-sm tracking-[0.4em] text-secondary uppercase max-w-3xl\\\">\\n              I buy back your time & weaponize your retention.\\n            </p>\\n            <motion.button \\n              whileHover={{ scale: 1.02 }}\\n              whileTap={{ scale: 0.98 }}\\n              className=\\\"mt-16 sm:mt-24 px-8 py-4 bg-white text-black font-semibold text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-black border border-white hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-max mx-auto group\\\"\\n            >\\n              Let\'s Chat \\n              <ArrowRight size={14} className=\\\"group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\\\" />\\n            </motion.button>\"},{\"ReplacementContent\":\"            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 border-t border-divider\\\">\\n              {pillars.map((pillar, idx) => (\\n                <div key={idx} className=\\\"flex flex-col p-[30px] md:p-[40px_30px] border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-divider last:border-b-0 lg:last:border-r-0\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-serif italic text-secondary text-[12px] mb-[12px]\\\">0{idx + 1}</span>\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"font-sans font-semibold text-[13px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-white mb-[8px]\\\">{pillar.title}</h3>\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-sans text-[11px] text-secondary leading-[1.5]\\\">\\n                    {pillar.description}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n              ))}\\n            </div>\",\"TargetContent\":\"            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-x-8 gap-y-16\\\">\\n              {pillars.map((pillar, idx) => (\\n                <div key={idx} className=\\\"flex flex-col border-t border-divider pt-6\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-secondary text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\\\">0{idx + 1}</span>\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"font-sans font-semibold text-lg md:text-xl text-white mb-4\\\">{pillar.title}</h3>\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-sans text-sm md:text-base text-secondary leading-relaxed font-light\\\">\\n                    {pillar.description}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n              ))}\\n            </div>\"},{\"ReplacementContent\":\"              <div className=\\\"font-serif italic text-[16px] text-white opacity-40\\\">\\n                \\\"I don\'t sell hours. I sell a Visual System that multiplies your views.\\\"\\n              </div>\",\"TargetContent\":\"              <h2 className=\\\"font-serif font-bold text-white text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.1] tracking-tight\\\">\\n                \\\"I don\'t sell hours. <br />\\n                <span className=\\\"text-secondary italic font-light\\\">I sell a Visual System that multiplies your views.</span>\\\"\\n              </h2>\"},{\"ReplacementContent\":\"            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n              <button className=\\\"px-[32px] py-[12px] bg-transparent text-primary text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 group border border-primary text-center w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n                Book Strategy Call\\n                <ArrowUpRight size={14} className=\\\"group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n              \\n              <button className=\\\"px-[32px] py-[12px] bg-transparent text-secondary text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 hover:text-white border border-transparent hover:border-divider flex items-center justify-center text-center w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n                Send DM\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\",\"TargetContent\":\"            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n              <button className=\\\"px-8 py-5 bg-white text-black font-semibold text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/90 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 group border border-white text-center w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n                Book Strategy Call\\n                <ArrowUpRight size={16} className=\\\"group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n              \\n              <button className=\\\"px-8 py-5 bg-transparent text-white font-semibold text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/5 border border-divider hover:border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-center w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n                Send DM\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\"}],\"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Edit layout components\",\"toolSummary\":\"Adjust App styles\"}"
